      "content": "i mean i know counselors exist but they dont get it. they just want to \"process\" things, but how do you process being a pariah? it’s not a mindset issue, it’s just the reality of my life now. it's like the world moved on and left me in a void. sometimes i just stare at the ceiling and think about how much easier it would be if i just... wasn't a factor. if i could just quit being part of this everything. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to stop trying to exist in this version of reality.",
